  "summary": "盘十一可读部分称命例廉相在子坐命、丁年生；壬寅限大限命宫有七杀火星，大限福德辰宫武曲化忌。后续武曲七杀相关解释被天梁破军等盘字插入，未据此复原。廉相作为原组称保留，不从混排恢复完整命盘。",
  "summary_en": "The readable Chart 11 passage describes a Ding-year  native with Lian Xiang in the Life Palace at Zi. In the Ren Yin grand cycle, Qi Sha and Huo Xing occupy the cycle Life Palace, while Wu Qu Hua Ji occupies the cycle Fortune Palace at Chen. Subsequent explanation is interrupted by chart labels and is not reconstructed. Lian Xiang is retained as the source group name rather than used to rebuild a complete chart.",
